{
  "schema": "orca.head_envelope.v1",
  "id": "bambu-h2d",
  "name": "Bambu Lab H2D / H2C (both nozzles; stock quick-swap hotends and ducts)",
  "provenance": "H2D, H2D Pro, H2C dual-nozzle H2 toolhead. One envelope for either active nozzle: the engine checks one head per print, so the idle hotend is modelled on both sides (left active -> right idle at +X; right active -> lifted left idle at -X). Nozzle spacing 25 mm from extruder_printable_area (0..325 vs 25..350) in the BambuStudio H2D/H2C presets (https://github.com/bambulab/BambuStudio/tree/master/resources/profiles/BBL/machine). Bambu: nominal left/right tip height difference 5 mm (https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/h2/manual/nozzle-offset-calibration); left hotend is cam-lifted above the right when idle (https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/h2/maintenance/replace-nozzle-lifting-rail). Idle hotend: the same nozzle bands and sock, tip at the 4 mm nozzle_height floor, the bound BambuStudio applies to the whole head for either nozzle. Nozzle: tip bands of the Bambu quick-swap hotend (0.6 mm land, 35-degree cone capped at 2 mm radius, from https://www.printables.com/model/533213 Hotend.STEP as in bambu-a1), clipped at the BambuStudio nozzle_height floor; Bambu's FAQ says this nozzle family is shared by H2D and P2S (https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/p2s/manual/p2s-faq) and its High Flow hotend is sold for H2/P2S (https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/bambu-high-flow-hotend-h2-p2s). extruder_clearance_height_to_rod 47.4, dist_to_rod 50, max_radius 96 -> gantry underside Z 47.4, symmetric Y span +-50; head half-width 46 mm about the head centre (12.5 mm off either tip). H2C shares the H2D clearances; its Vortek induction hotend (https://www.voxelmatters.com/bambu-lab-announces-h2c-and-new-vortek-hotend-change-system/) sits in the right slot within the same sock envelope. Body boxes are estimates from Bambu wiki/store toolhead photos with the BambuStudio clearances as hard anchors; axial/lateral margins 0.3 mm. Nozzle-tip frame +X right, +Y rear, +Z up, mm. Derived 2026-11-11; calibrated=false.",
  "calibrated": false,
  "nozzle": {
    "tip_flat_radius": 0.3,
    "allowance_radius": 3.0,
    "allowance_height": 1.0
  },
  "margin": 0.3,
  "lateral_margin": 0.3,
